@title Generated pages: every column header of a dense table is drawn at 1366x768
@area Options
# The Wire list page with the Option column is the densest table of the example. At a small window the canvas lifts small
# text to the reading floor; a header must be kept inside its own cell (Route length mm used to be dropped).
open qa/fixtures/machine-options.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Reports #2
wait 20
click_text "Wire list"
wait 10
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Add report as drawing page
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Schematic #1
wait 10
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 6
shot wire-list-headers
check_layout
